{
	cat << EOF
Usage: $(basename $0) [options] <input file> <output file> <test> <test> <other args...>

dies iræ, dies illa solvet sæculum in favilla : teste David cum Sibilla! sdf neon none"          sdf waka wakat Print the most frèẌquent
tree structure in the given range, ciao eh waka waka eh eh what none is this

Options:
  -a, --aaa <a>                       aaabaaaaaa (<a>=string matching regex /one\*/, default=one*)
  --ooo <type>                        ooo (<type>=string matching regex /low|high|sem|anim|semrand[A-J]/, default=low)
  -c, --cat <cat>                     category (<cat>=string matching regex /low|sem|high|anim|semrand[A-J]/, default=low)
  -m, --out-mode <mode of operation>  output mode (<mode of operation>=string matching regex /(te|et).[a-z]?|ps-(file|viewer)|(svg|ps)-file/,
                                      default=te%t)
  -s, --str <s>                       pippo? (<s>=string, default=pippo)
  -n, --num-nodes <N>                 number of nodes (<N>=float in [0.1:0.01:INF), default=0.19)
  -u, --num-notes <N>                 number of nodes (<N>=int, default=233) [this option may be given more than once]
